WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.423
The evaluation is deliberately broad.

00:00:02.503 --> 00:00:04.723
On the masked-language-model side,

00:00:04.803 --> 00:00:09.662
it uses RoBERTa-large on six
sentence-classification and inference tasks,

00:00:09.742 --> 00:00:17.578
tested in both a few-shot regime with sixteen
examples per class and a many-shot regime with five hundred and twelve.

00:00:17.658 --> 00:00:19.404
On the autoregressive side,

00:00:19.484 --> 00:00:25.561
it uses OPT models ranging from one-point-three
billion up to sixty-six billion parameters,

00:00:25.641 --> 00:00:28.538
evaluated on SuperGLUE classification tasks,

00:00:28.618 --> 00:00:31.447
multiple-choice tasks like COPA and ReCoRD,

00:00:31.527 --> 00:00:34.559
and generation tasks including SQuAD and DROP.

00:00:34.639 --> 00:00:39.700
Baselines include zero-shot prediction, in-context
learning, linear probing,

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:41.730
and standard Adam fine-tuning.
